                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_ACKNOWLEDGE.0.text":  "{callsign_shortened}, 收到。",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_ACKNOWLEDGE.0.tts":  "{callsign_shortened}, roger.",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_ACKNOWLEDGE_PUBLISHED_MISSED_APPROACH.0.text":  "{callsign} 收到。执行公布的复飞程序。到达 {altitude_new} 时告知以获取进一步指示。",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_ACKNOWLEDGE_PUBLISHED_MISSED_APPROACH.0.tts":  "{callsign} roger. Fly published missed approach. Advise reaching {altitude_new} for further instructions.",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_AIRPORT_IFR.0.text":  "{callsign}, {agent}, 机场目前为仪表飞行规则。 拒绝请求。",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_AIRPORT_IFR.0.tts":  "{callsign}, {agent}, airport is currently IFR. Request denied.",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_APPROACH_POSITION.0.text":  "{callsign_shortened}, 机场在 {oclock_destination_airport}方向, 距离你{distance_destination_airport} 英里。 {vector} 看到跑道时报告。",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_APPROACH_POSITION.0.tts":  "{callsign_shortened}, airport is {distance_destination_airport} miles at your {oclock_destination_airport}. {vector} Report runway in sight.",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_APPROACH_POSITION.1.text":  "{callsign_shortened}, 机场在你 {oclock_destination_airport}方向, {distance_destination_airport} 英里处 {vector} 看到跑道时报告。",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_APPROACH_POSITION.1.tts":  "{callsign_shortened}, airport is at your {oclock_destination_airport}, {distance_destination_airport} miles. {vector} Report runway in sight.",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_ATC_TERMINATED.0.text":  "{callsign_shortened}, ATC服务终止。 {AGNT_HUMAN}",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_ATC_TERMINATED.0.tts":  "{callsign_shortened}, ATC services terminated. {AGNT_HUMAN}",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_CANCEL_IFR.0.text":  "{callsign_shortened}, 仪表飞行计划已取消, 雷达服务终止。应答机 {squawk_reset_value}。保持目视飞行规则。频率变更核准。{AGNT_HUMAN}",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_CANCEL_IFR.0.tts":  "{callsign_shortened}, IFR flight plan is cancelled, radar service terminated. Squawk {squawk_reset_value}. Maintain VFR. Frequency change approved. {AGNT_HUMAN}",
                                                "ATCCOM.AGNT_AC_CANCEL_IFR_CONFIRM.0.text":  "{callsign_shortened}, 明白取消仪表飞行计划。请确认。",
